sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Clinician
    participant Web as React Web App
    participant API as Hono API Server
    participant FHIR as FHIR R4 Server
    participant AI as OpenRouter AI

    Note over Web,API: Requests and responses use shared Zod contracts

    Clinician->>Web: Open Demo EHR
    Web-->>Clinician: Display patient search

    Clinician->>Web: Enter name, DOB, or MRN
    Web->>API: GET /api/patients
    API->>FHIR: Search Patient resources
    FHIR-->>API: FHIR search bundle
    API-->>Web: Normalized patient results
    Web-->>Clinician: Display matching patients

    Clinician->>Web: Select patient
    Web->>API: GET /api/patients/:id/context
    API->>FHIR: Fetch patient and clinical records
    FHIR-->>API: Patient, medications, and documents
    API-->>Web: Normalized patient context
    Web-->>Clinician: Display reconciliation workspace

    Clinician->>Web: Enter current medication report
    Web->>API: POST /api/patients/:id/reconciliations
    API->>FHIR: Refresh patient context
    FHIR-->>API: Current source records
    API->>AI: Send grounded reconciliation prompt
    AI-->>API: Structured reconciliation analysis
    API->>API: Validate output and evidence IDs
    API-->>Web: Findings, summary, and source records
    Web-->>Clinician: Display clinician-review brief
